    "Choose full access or select specific photos in the system prompt. We use capture times and on-device visual comparisons to help you review nearby shots. Deletions require a separate confirmation and go to Recently Deleted." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the photo access UI.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在系统提示中选择完全访问，或挑选特定照片。我们使用拍摄时间和设备本地的视觉比对，帮助你查看相近的照片。删除需另行确认，并移至“最近删除”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在系統提示中選擇完全存取，或挑選特定相片。我們使用拍攝時間和裝置本機的視覺比對，協助你查看相近的相片。刪除需另行確認，並移至「最近刪除」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
