    "Comparisons use local previews only. Nothing is changed unless you confirm an action." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the limitations of the app's",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比对仅使用本地预览。除非你确认操作，否则不会更改任何内容。"
