    "Default 0.40. Lower is stricter. Pairs at or below this distance join a group. Changes regroup existing scores when you close settings." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the default threshold for grouping similar photos.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认 0.40。数值越低越严格。距离不超过此值的照片对会归入同一组。关闭设置时更改会重新分组现有评分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設 0.40。數值越低越嚴格。距離不超過此值的相片對會歸入同一組。關閉設定時更改會重新分組現有評分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
