    "On the home screen, each feature scans only up to this many results before pausing, so opening the app doesn't run all three scans to completion at once. Opening a feature's list scans the rest up to the buffer above. Default 50." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the initial scan setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在主屏幕上，每项功能最多扫描到此数量的结果就暂停，这样打开应用时不会一次性把三项扫描全部跑完。打开某项功能的列表会继续扫描，直至上方的缓冲数量。默认 50。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
