      }
    },
    "When on, photo pairs that both have location data and are farther apart than this are skipped without a visual comparison, speeding up the scan. Pairs missing location on either side are always compared. Changes take effect on the next scan (pull to refresh)." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the location-based filtering of similar photos.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，两张都带有位置数据且相距超过此值的照片对会被跳过，不做视觉比对，从而加快扫描。任一张缺少位置的照片对仍会比对。更改在下次扫描时生效（下拉刷新）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，兩張都帶有位置資料且相距超過此值的相片對會被略過，不做視覺比對，從而加快掃描。任一張缺少位置的相片對仍會比對。更改在下次掃描時生效（下拉重新整理）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With limited access, only the photos you allow can be scanned. Scores use Vision and local previews without automatic iCloud downloads." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the app uses your photos.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
